],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffff"}],"comments":[{"name":"Cardinality: Hardware -> Software","secName":"","comment":"","group":"","x0":370,"y0":583,"x1":92,"y1":472,"x2":192,"y2":391,"conceptual":true,"logical":false,"physical":true,"lines":["Perhaps we want to put a new Hardware in","the DB that has no Software installed yet"],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffc5"},{"name":"Relationship: manages","secName":"","comment":"","group":"","x0":840,"y0":105,"x1":136,"y1":633,"x2":236,"y2":552,"conceptual":true,"logical":false,"physical":true,"lines":["To ensure that there is only one Manager per","Classroom, we need to put the FK in the Classroom","class (as it is a one-to-one relationship)"],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffc5"},{"name":"Relationship: installation","secName":"","comment":"","group":"","x0":29,"y0":298,"x1":458,"y1":631,"x2":558,"y2":550,"conceptual":true,"logical":false,"physical":true,"lines":["To me it is not fully clear whether the relationship","is between Software and Hardware or Software and","Classroom, as in the given list, there is a list of PCs","for one room. However, it makes more sense to put","the relationship between Software and Hardware"],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffc5"},{"name":"Attribute: phoneNbr","secName":"","comment":"","group":"","x0":473,"y0":104,"x1":118,"y1":200,"x2":218,"y2":119,"conceptual":true,"logical":false,"physical":true,"lines":["To me it is not fully clear whether the phoneNbr belongs","to the room or the Person. I now put it in the Classroom,","as it seems to be a short internal number"],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffc5"},{"name":"Relationship Class <-> Classroom","secName":"","comment":"","group":"","x0":116,"y0":107,"x1":429,"y1":177,"x2":352,"y2":160,"conceptual":true,"logical":false,"physical":true,"lines":["I put 0..* twice because perhaps we want to save a class","which has no courses (at the moment) and we can also","have classrooms which have not been used yet"],"foreground":"#000000","background":"#ffffc5"}]}